<title>Memoria OS 外壳总装工程图 v1.0 · 重画板子专用</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect width='64' height='64' rx='12' fill='%23182030'/%3E%3Crect x='12' y='20' width='40' height='24' rx='4' fill='%23304060'/%3E%3Ctext x='32' y='37' font-size='14' text-anchor='middle' fill='%23ffd54a' font-family='sans-serif'%3EM%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#0f1420; --panel:#161d2e; --panel2:#1b2438; --line:#2a3550;
  --txt:#dde4f0; --dim:#8a95ad; --faint:#5b667d;
  --blue:#5aa2f0; --green:#5fd08a; --amber:#f0b95a; --red:#f06a6a; --purple:#b07af0; --cyan:#5ad0d0;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--txt);font:14px/1.6 "Segoe UI","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;padding:24px 18px 60px}
.wrap{max-width:1180px;margin:0 auto}
header{border-bottom:2px solid var(--line);padding-bottom:14px;margin-bottom:20px}
h1{font-size:22px;letter-spacing:1px}
h1 .ver{color:var(--blue);font-size:13px;margin-left:8px}
.sub{color:var(--dim);font-size:12.5px;margin-top:4px}
.badges{margin-top:10px}
.badge{display:inline-block;font-size:11px;padding:2px 10px;border-radius:20px;margin-right:6px;border:1px solid var(--line)}
.badge.ok{color:var(--green);border-color:var(--green)}
.badge.warn{color:var(--amber);border-color:var(--amber)}
.badge.bad{color:var(--red);border-color:var(--red)}
h2{font-size:16px;margin:30px 0 12px;padding-left:10px;border-left:4px solid var(--blue)}
h2 .en{color:var(--faint);font-size:11px;margin-left:6px;letter-spacing:1px}
.card{background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:16px;margin-bottom:16px}
.card h3{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--blue);margin-bottom:10px}
.grid3{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:14px}
@media(max-width:900px){.grid3{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
.view{background:var(--panel2);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:8px;text-align:center}
.view .cap{font-size:12px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:6px}
svg text{font-family:"Segoe UI","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif}
.dim{fill:var(--blue);font-size:10px}
.lab{fill:var(--dim);font-size:9.5px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:12.5px;margin-top:8px}
th{background:var(--panel2);color:var(--cyan);text-align:left;padding:6px 8px;border:1px solid var(--line);font-weight:600}
td{padding:5px 8px;border:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top}
td.m{font-family:Consolas,"Courier New",monospace;color:#cfe3ff}
tr:nth-child(even) td{background:rgba(255,255,255,.02)}
.warn-row td{background:rgba(240,106,106,.08)}
.ok-row td{background:rgba(95,208,138,.06)}
.note{font-size:12px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;background:rgba(90,162,240,.06);border-left:3px solid var(--blue);border-radius:0 6px 6px 0}
.warn-note{background:rgba(240,106,106,.08);border-left-color:var(--red)}
.ok-note{background:rgba(95,208,138,.08);border-left-color:var(--green)}
.coord{font-family:Consolas,monospace;color:var(--purple)}
.hl{color:var(--amber);font-weight:700}
.stack{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px;max-width:340px;margin:10px auto}
.layer{display:flex;align-items:center;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px}
.layer .nm{flex:1;font-weight:600}
.layer .ht{font-family:Consolas,monospace;color:#fff}
.l-fs{background:#2b3a52}
.l-sc{background:#1f4a5a}
.l-gap{background:#232c40;color:var(--dim)}
.l-key{background:#4a3a1a}
.l-pcb{background:#3d5a2a}
.l-gap2{background:#232c40;color:var(--dim)}
.l-bat{background:#5a2a2a}
.l-bs{background:#2b3a52}
.stack .arrow{text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--dim);padding:2px 0}
.legend{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 16px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--dim);margin-top:8px}
.legend i{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;margin-right:4px;vertical-align:-1px}
@media print{body{background:#fff;color:#000}.card{break-inside:avoid}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">

<header>
  <h1>Memoria OS 外壳总装工程图<span class="ver">v1.0 · 2026-10-01</span></h1>
  <div class="sub">用途：重画 3D 外壳 / 洞洞板布局的**唯一尺寸依据**。数据来源：design/ 下 5 份图纸交叉核对 + 硬件讨论纪要。冲突项已标红，待实测项已标黄。</div>
  <div class="badges">
    <span class="badge ok">整机 110 × 160 × 20mm（定版）</span>
    <span class="badge warn">3 项待实测（屏/摇杆/开关）</span>
    <span class="badge bad">旧稿 40.1mm 已作废</span>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ========== 01 三视图 ========== -->
<h2>01 三视图 <span class="en">THREE VIEWS · 单位 mm · 原点 = 前面板左上角，X 右 Y 下</span></h2>
<div class="grid3">

  <!-- 正面 -->
  <div class="card">
    <h3>正面（前面板，2.5mm 厚）</h3>
    <div class="view">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 220 320" width="100%">
        <rect x="10" y="10" width="200" height="300" rx="8" fill="#1a2233" stroke="#3a4760" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <!-- 屏幕窗 86×58 @ (12,10)-(98,68) -->
        <rect x="34" y="30" width="172" height="116" rx="4" fill="#0a0e18" stroke="#5aa2f0" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5,3"/>
        <text x="120" y="92" text-anchor="middle" class="dim">屏幕开窗 86 × 58</text>
        <text x="120" y="106" text-anchor="middle" class="lab">模组 56×84 从内卡入 · 视窗 70.8×48.5</text>
        <!-- 麦克风孔 Ø2.6 @ (55,3) -->
        <circle cx="120" cy="22" r="5.2" fill="#0a0e18" stroke="#5aa2f0" stroke-width="1.2"/>
        <text x="120" y="12" text-anchor="middle" class="lab">麦克风 Ø2.6</text>
        <!-- 摇杆孔 Ø20 @ (34,102) -->
        <circle cx="68" cy="214" r="20" fill="#0a0e18" stroke="#5aa2f0" stroke-width="1.5"/>
        <text x="68" y="212" text-anchor="middle" class="dim">摇杆孔 Ø20</text>
        <text x="68" y="234" text-anchor="middle" class="lab">中心 (34,102)</text>
        <!-- 键孔区 97×57 -->
        <rect x="13" y="180" width="194" height="114" fill="none" stroke="#5fd08a" stroke-width="1" stroke-dasharray="4,3"/>
        <text x="120" y="170" text-anchor="middle" class="dim">键盘孔区 97 × 57 · 60 键 · 中心距 10</text>
        <!-- 键孔示意 (3×4) -->
        <g fill="#0a0e18" stroke="#5fd08a" stroke-width="0.8">
          <rect x="31" y="193" width="14.6" height="14.6"/><rect x="59" y="193" width="14.6" height="14.6"/><rect x="87" y="193" width="14.6" height="14.6"/>
          <rect x="31" y="221" width="14.6" height="14.6"/><rect x="59" y="221" width="14.6" height="14.6"/><rect x="87" y="221" width="14.6" height="14.6"/>
          <rect x="31" y="249" width="14.6" height="14.6"/><rect x="59" y="249" width="14.6" height="14.6"/><rect x="87" y="249" width="14.6" height="14.6"/>
        </g>
        <!-- 侧键孔 3× 8×22 -->
        <rect x="8" y="124" width="6" height="44" fill="#0a0e18" stroke="#5aa2f0"/>
        <rect x="8" y="184" width="6" height="44" fill="#0a0e18" stroke="#5aa2f0"/>
        <rect x="8" y="244" width="6" height="44" fill="#0a0e18" stroke="#5aa2f0"/>
        <text x="3" y="150" class="lab" transform="rotate(-90 8 150)">侧键 ×3 · 8×22</text>
        <!-- 螺丝柱 -->
        <circle cx="18" cy="18" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#b07af0"/><circle cx="202" cy="18" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#b07af0"/>
        <circle cx="18" cy="302" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#b07af0"/><circle cx="202" cy="302" r="6" fill="none" stroke="#b07af0"/>
        <text x="110" y="315" text-anchor="middle" class="lab">4 角 M2 螺丝柱 Ø3 · 高 14</text>
      </svg>
      <div class="cap">正面视图 · 前面板厚 2.5mm · 建议 3D 打印/亚克力</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- 右侧剖 -->
  <div class="card">
    <h3>右侧剖视（层叠结构）</h3>
    <div class="view">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 220 340" width="100%">
        <!-- 层条 -->
        <rect x="30" y="20"  width="160" height="16" rx="3" fill="#2b3a52"/><text x="196" y="32" class="lab">前壳 2.5</text>
        <rect x="30" y="38"  width="160" height="14" rx="3" fill="#1f4a5a"/><text x="196" y="48" class="lab">屏幕总成 3</text>
        <rect x="30" y="54"  width="160" height="4"  fill="#232c40"/>
